{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026oo3KjQ2l8l1793183503.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>澳洲航空的地勤與貨運員工發動24小時罷工，澳航預料，不會影響內陸與國際客運航班。</p><p></p><p>工業行動由澳洲運輸工人工會發起，爭取改善薪酬與福利、及提升工作安全，受影響的機場，包括在悉尼、墨爾本、布里斯班、阿德萊德及珀斯等，預計有六百人參與罷工。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.AUS.QANTAS-1700_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20264J5hBT0Aex1793183515.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>由於參與工業行動的地勤人員主要隸屬澳航貨運，預計貨運裝卸服務將出現延誤。澳航發言人表示，已啟動應變計劃，國內與國際客運航班預計不會受影響。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T11:41:51.128077+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T09:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:18:16.136907+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T11:38:23.311420+00:00","content_hash":"62b53903a75bbcf5123ceee9024183999be415fd85f520c180a03a259b6d87d1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T11:41:51.128077+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}